# Bot2's March of the Machines makes Bot1's Sol Ring a 1/1 artifact creature. Venerated Loxodon is cast with Sol Ring
# and one Ornithopter tapped for convoke (CR 702.51a) and three Plains paying the rest. With the enters trigger on the
# stack Bot2's Disenchant destroys March: Sol Ring convoked (CR 702.51c) but is no longer a creature, and "each creature
# that convoked it" means each creature permanent on the battlefield that did (CR 109.2), so it gets no counter. The
# Ornithopter that convoked gets its one (1/3 from 0/2); the other Ornithopter, which did not convoke, gets none.

